📗
  📢 The logger. A line has a time, a level and a message, and may have
  fields: names and values in turn.

    📢 app❗️ ➡️ log
    💡 log 🔤cache warmed🔤❗️
    📝 log 🔤warn🔤 🔤slow query🔤 🍿 🔤table🔤 🔤todos🔤 🔤ms🔤 🔤812🔤 🍆❗️

  The levels are debug, info, warn and error. A line below the logger's own
  level is not written, and at off none is. A line goes to standard output
  in one write, as text or as a JSON object:

    2026-10-07T12:34:56.789Z WARN  slow query table=todos ms=812
    {"time":"2026-10-07T12:34:56.789Z","level":"warn","message":"slow query","table":"todos","ms":"812"}

  Whatever a message or a value holds, a line stays one line: control
  characters are written as escapes. To send lines somewhere else, give the
  logger a 🗞 of your own.
📗
